// "Discard this card:" ([CR#702.29a]) — the BOUND self-discard cost
// (cycling, reinforce): the degenerate no-choice discard of the card the
// ability rides on. The keyword action as DATA in its single-move form: a
// `Composite` whose tag is `Discard(You, 1)` and whose body IS the Hand →
// Graveyard `Move` of `This` — the destroy shape, committed atomically on
// ONE dual-facet `Act(Discard)` where madness's replacement bites
// ([CR#702.35a]; cycling a madness card exiles it instead). `SacrificeThis`'s
// sibling on the cost lane.
(
    name: "DiscardThis",
    template: "Discard this card",
    kinds: [CostComponent],
    body: Do(Composite(name: Discard, body: Move(This, Graveyard))),
)
